  "issue": "ENG-2439",
  "body": "Line is $407,944, not the $374,654 the SVB notices add up to (29 notices). Leapblock closed our file on Feb 13 and reported 30 USD wires received totalling $407,944 (2023 $104,868 / 2024 $232,726 / 2025 $62,950 / 2026 $7,400). The by-year figures match the notices except 2023: the missing wire is their first one, $33,290 on Sep 13 2023, which has no Payment Processed notice in my mail. Per the counting rule their closeout beats the notices. By date that wire is Domino Delights, Build. Split: DD $337,594 / ZM $59,250 / CF $11,100."
 },
