  "body": "Line is $0, not the $4,000 on the notice. Blake confirmed (email \"Chase records\", Feb 13) that the Aug 19 2024 $4,000 to JPMorgan ***3203 was our own Chase account: he moved the money back after Carta's renewal came out of Chase. It never left the company, so no bucket. The line stays at zero."
